        "description": "The body is fal's input for fal-ai/gemini-3.1-flash-tts, forwarded to fal unchanged; a success answer carries fal's output under `output`. Behaves as fal.queue.v1 describes. Each URL output pointer names the URL itself, and a `*` stands for every item of a list. URL fields nested deeper aren't listed in inputs or outputs; the schemas show them.",
